Package: rpi-web-control
Version: 0.11.0-1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: rpi-web-control maintainers <maintainers@rpi-web-control.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-picamera2 (>= 0.3.26), python3-numpy, python3-pil, python3-libgpiod, python3-serial, adduser, openssl, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), systemd, fdisk, e2fsprogs, util-linux, mount, udev, iproute2
Recommends: network-manager, python3-dbus, dnsmasq-base
Description: Network camera and recording control for Raspberry Pi 5 and CM5
 Web interface for live preview, RTP streaming, indexed recording,
 recording downloads, PCIe NVMe and USB storage, hardware triggers and board settings.
